<template><section id="electricity-library" class="electricity-library" aria-labelledby="electricity-title"><header class="electricity-heading"><h2 id="electricity-title"><button type="button" class="electricity-title" :aria-expanded="opened" aria-controls="electricity-content" @click="opened=!opened"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m13 2-9 12h7l-1 8 10-13h-7z"/></svg>电学知识与用电工具 <span aria-hidden="true">{{opened?'▾':'▸'}}</span></button></h2><div><span>{{entries.length}} 条知识 · 3 个计算工具</span><button type="button" :aria-expanded="opened" aria-controls="electricity-content" @click="opened=!opened">{{opened?'收起 ▴':'展开 ▾'}}</button></div></header><div v-if="opened" id="electricity-content"><nav class="electricity-tabs" aria-label="电学知识分类"><button v-for="name in categories" :key="name" type="button" :aria-pressed="active===name" @click="active=name"><ToolEntryIcon :name="name==='计算工具'?'calculator':name==='用电常识'?'password':'基础概念'" />{{name}}</button></nav><template v-if="active!=='计算工具'"><input v-model="query" type="search" aria-label="搜索电学知识" placeholder="搜索 电压 / 功率因数 / 插线板" /><p>{{filtered.length}} 条知识 · 概念学习与参数估算，非市电接线或带电测量指导。</p><div class="electricity-grid"><article v-for="entry in filtered" :key="entry.id" class="electricity-card"><small>{{entry.category}} · {{entry.unit}}</small><h3><ToolEntryIcon :name="entry.category==='用电常识'?'password':'系统'" />{{entry.title}}</h3><p>{{entry.text}}</p><a :href="entry.source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">参考资料 ↗</a></article></div><p v-if="!filtered.length">没有匹配的知识。<button type="button" @click="query='';active='全部知识'">清除筛选</button></p></template><div v-else class="electricity-calculators"><section class="electricity-card" aria-label="欧姆定律计算器"><h3>欧姆定律</h3><label>计算目标<select v-model="ohmTarget" @change="a='';b=''"><option value="current">电流 I = U / R</option><option value="voltage">电压 U = I × R</option><option value="resistance">电阻 R = U / I</option></select></label><label>{{firstLabel}}<input v-model="a" type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label><label>{{secondLabel}}<input v-model="b" type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label><output aria-live="polite">{{ohm.error||format(ohm.value)+' '+ohm.unit}}</output><p>用于直流欧姆元件计算；分母须大于零。交流复杂负载不能只按电阻套用。</p></section><section class="electricity-card" aria-label="电量与电费估算"><h3>电量与电费估算</h3><label>平均功率（W）<input v-model="watts" type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label><label>每天使用（小时）<input v-model="hours" type="number" min="0" max="24" step="any" /></label><label>使用天数<input v-model="days" type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label><label>单价（元/kWh）<input v-model="price" type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label><output aria-live="polite">{{energy.error||format(energy.energy)+' kWh · '+format(energy.cost)+' 元'}}</output><p>功率÷1000×小时×天数；按固定平均功率和单价估算，不包含阶梯、峰谷、税费或设备启停变化。</p></section><section class="electricity-card" aria-label="单相交流功率计算"><h3>单相交流功率</h3><label>有效值电压（V）<input v-model="voltage" type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label><label>有效值电流（A）<input v-model="current" type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label><label>功率因数（0～1）<input v-model="pf" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="any" /></label><output aria-live="polite">{{ac.error||'视在 '+format(ac.apparent)+' VA / 有功 '+format(ac.active)+' W'}}</output><p>S = U有效值 × I有效值，P = S × PF。不是三相公式，也不据此选择线径、断路器或插座容量。</p></section></div></div></section></template>
<script>
import ToolEntryIcon from './ToolEntryIcon.vue';
import {electricityEntries,calculateOhm,calculateEnergy,calculateAC} from '../data/electricity-tools.mjs';
export default {name:'ElectricityLibrary',components:{ToolEntryIcon},data:()=>({opened:false,active:'全部知识',query:'',entries:electricityEntries,ohmTarget:'current',a:'12',b:'6',watts:'100',hours:'8',days:'30',price:'0.6',voltage:'220',current:'2',pf:'0.9'}),computed:{categories(){return ['全部知识',...new Set(this.entries.map(e=>e.category)),'计算工具'];},filtered(){const words=this.query.trim().toLowerCase().split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);return this.entries.filter(e=>(this.active==='全部知识'||e.category===this.active)&&words.every(w=>(e.title+' '+e.text+' '+e.category+' '+e.unit).toLowerCase().includes(w)));},firstLabel(){return this.ohmTarget==='voltage'?'电流（A）':'电压（V）';},secondLabel(){return this.ohmTarget==='resistance'?'电流（A）':'电阻（Ω）';},ohm(){return calculateOhm(this.ohmTarget,this.a,this.b);},energy(){return calculateEnergy(this.watts,this.hours,this.days,this.price);},ac(){return calculateAC(this.voltage,this.current,this.pf);}},methods:{format(value){return Number(value.toPrecision(8)).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{maximumFractionDigits:8});}}};
</script>
<style scoped>.electricity-library{margin:32px 20px;padding:20px;font-size:13px;scroll-margin-top:80px;}.electricity-heading,.electricity-heading>div{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;}h2{margin:0;}.electricity-title{border:0!important;background:transparent!important;padding:0;text-align:left;font:inherit;}.electricity-title svg{width:19px;height:19px;vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:6px;}button,input,select{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--el-fill-color-blank);border:1px solid var(--el-border-color);padding:8px 10px;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;}button{cursor:pointer;}.electricity-tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:16px 0;}.electricity-grid,.electricity-calculators{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;}.electricity-card{padding:16px;background:var(--el-fill-color-blank);border:1px solid var(--el-border-color-light);border-radius:5px;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}h3{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:10px 0;}p{line-height:1.8;color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);}small{color:var(--el-text-color-secondary);}a{color:var(--ui-accent);}.electricity-card label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin:12px 0;}.electricity-card input,.electricity-card select{width:100%;}output{display:block;line-height:1.8;padding:12px;background:var(--el-fill-color-light);overflow-wrap:anywhere;}@media(max-width:1100px){.electricity-grid,.electricity-calculators{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));}}@media(max-width:600px){.electricity-library{margin:16px 12px;padding:14px;}.electricity-grid,.electricity-calculators{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);}}</style>
